  "packageSize": 5445794,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/ilwren/hcvault",
  "published": "2026-10-16T13:48:35.99Z",
  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE-README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.6.3: library update, vcapi v4 to v6 - vc_open_volume gains a kdf_name parameter (NULL = auto-detect as before, a KDF name = open with exactly that KDF), and the exFAT file API gains vc_exfat_tell / vc_exfat_size / vc_exfat_flush for streaming access. Fixed: the exFAT bridge passed unprefixed paths to FatFs, which resolves them against a process-global current drive - with two volumes mounted at once, operations could hit the wrong mount; paths are now pinned to their own mount and all FatFs entry points are serialized, so volumes can be used concurrently from multiple threads. Volumes are compatible with 1.4.x/1.5.x/1.6.x; HCVault.Core 1.6.3 requires this vcapi v6 build.",
